<p class="mut" style="font-size:12px" id="order-note">† Previous/next order: splits follow the story beats in the docs' walkthrough index (Roark → Gardenia → Fantina → Maylene → Wake → Byron → Candice → Galactic arc → Volkner → Elite Four). Within a split, areas and trainers follow the mastersheet split tab's row order. That is sheet order, not a verified walking route, so branches inside an area aren't modelled. When the next trainer is marked OPTIONAL in the sheet, every option up to the next non-optional trainer is listed. Starter variants (“Player chose …”) are shown as alternatives. Each “MULTI BATTLE with …” pair from the sheet is merged into one fight (“A + B (multi battle)”), so it counts as one step.</p>
